{"1489980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bravest Burden", "steam_appid": 1489980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CO-OP ONLY ACTION RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to party up and <strong>scout, scavenge, </strong>and<strong> battle through a hostile world</strong> to deliver dangerous cargo that attracts relentless danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, Equipment, Skills, Passives, Status Conditions, and co-op Combos all drive the combat in Bravest Burden. There are dozens of enemy types, special Elite enemies that intelligently hunt you down and disable you, and tricky Boss battles requiring teamwork and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout, Scavenge, Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push into dangerous zones to progress, finding gear along the way. Reach safe zones for some much needed respite.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489980/extras/93c4990f2e9991408272f390537a1107.poster.avif?t=1777904712\" width=1170 height=744 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489980/extras/93c4990f2e9991408272f390537a1107.webm?t=1777904712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489980/extras/93c4990f2e9991408272f390537a1107.mp4?t=1777904712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Hero Customization</strong><br>Choose from four species and classes, shaping your hero with <strong>traits, a unique Skill T