enge Every Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your character for complimenting different groups, try new tactics, and see how your <strong>teamwork changes each run</strong> while battling<strong> </strong>against dynamic gameplay challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN THE FELLOWSHIP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bravest Burden is a passion project built for players who love <strong>co-op action, shared challenge, and stories shaped by their unique experience</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’ve ever wanted to have a classic, party-based adventure with friends, without days of setup and grind - this is for you.</p>", "short_description": "A pure co-op Action RPG where you and your allies scout, scavenge, and battle hordes - all to deliver precious cargo that draws relentless danger. The Sanctifiers must always arrive!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489980/1d791e75c7bd1945d098fd45c2abfc4e3dde2665/header.jpg?t=1777904712", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489980/c9de2538be157394a26acab989a5b62201dd0b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777904712", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489980/c9de2538be157394a26acab989a5b62201dd0b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777904712", "website": "https://www.bravestburden.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB graphics memory and directx 9.0c compatible gpu<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet co